<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Computer Learning rated outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Computer Learning rated outperform.</headline>
<text>
<p>--EVEREN Securities Inc said Friday it initiated coverage of Computer Learning Centers Inc with an outperform rating.</p>
<p>--The education company is well positioned to benefit from the growing need for a technology-literate workforce, EVEREN said in a report.</p>
<p>--Its earnings estimates are $1.08 per share for FY97 and $1.30 for FY98.</p>
<p>-- Computer Learning was trading at 28-1/2, up 1/2.</p>
<p>	    ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
